
@startuml
actor User
participant "Resume Service" as RS
participant "Review Service" as ReS
participant "Notification Service" as NS
participant "Payment Service" as PS
actor Admin

User -> RS: 1. Click 'get your CV reviewed'
RS -> User: 2. Prompt to upload CV
User -> RS: 3. Prompt User to Login or Signup
User -> RS: 4. Upload CV
RS -> User: 5. Prompt Payment Plan (Standard £50 / Priority £80)
User -> PS: 6. Select Payment Plan
PS -> PS: 7. Process Payment
PS -> RS: 8. Payment Confirmation
RS -> User: 9. Push 'review in progress' message
RS -> ReS: 10. Notify new review request
ReS -> NS: 11. Notify Admin of new review request
NS -> Admin: 12. Send notification
ReS -> User: 13. Update status to pending
Admin -> ReS: 14. Review CV
ReS -> Admin: 15. Admin reviews CV
ReS -> User: 16. Update status to in-progress
Admin -> ReS: 17. Complete review and provide feedback
ReS -> NS: 18. Notify User of review completion
NS -> User: 19. Send Notification
ReS -> User: 20. Update status to completed
User -> RS: 21. Login to view reviewed CV
RS -> User: 22. Display reviewed CV and feedback
User -> RS: 23. Download CV
@enduml

